461899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/cd66ff0c1b1bee95f1fdb7501273ab59.avif?t=1755461899\" data-has-big width=800 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your units gain experience through battles, represented by a growing star. The more experienced a unit is, the more powerful it becomes in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/1d022b651ed01fc47487cb8c1e8464bc.poster.avif?t=1755461899\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/1d022b651ed01fc47487cb8c1e8464bc.webm?t=1755461899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/1d022b651ed01fc47487cb8c1e8464bc.mp4?t=1755461899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/cd66ff0c1b1bee95f1fdb7501273ab59.avif?t=1755461899\" data-has-big width=800 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And heroes, of course!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero enters the playing field via the <strong>main fortress</strong>. Heroes can either <strong>fight</strong> and <strong>conquer</strong> villages, <strong>search</strong> for treasures, <strong>hunt</strong> monsters or <strong>occupy</strong> magical rune fields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When conquered, these runes trigger permanent <strong>boosts\u00a0</strong>for your army. These last until another hero can conquer them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes also provide many tactical options. For example, special <strong>hero units</strong> can be acquired in the main fortress or powerful <strong>special actions</strong> can be triggered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/f20cd889276e5201de62822c223e7498.poster.avif?t=1755461899\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/f20cd889276e5201de62822c223e7498.webm?t=1755461899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135030/extras/f20cd889276e5201de62822c223e7498.mp4?t=1755461899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong and dynamic AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unlockable battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different heroes with their own special units and special actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable map generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tactical features such as \u2018magic runes\u2019, \u2018experience\u2019, \u2018flank protection\u2019, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Details</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your opponent on a playing field organised into hexes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playing field contains various terrains such as forests, mountains and lakes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, there are towns, castles, harbours, strongholds, fortresses and more. These towns must be conquered and held by foot troops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This allows you to increase your gold income and recruit many different units. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroes play a special role. They enter the playing field via your main fortress and can take part in the battle. They can also collect treasure chests, conquer powerful rune fields or fight creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have collected enough souls through battles, heroes can perform a particularly powerful special action to turn the battle in your favour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only with tactical skill and foresight can you defeat the computer opponent or other players. </p>",
